			"notes": "Adds list-only teleport selection for ordinary Nexus compasses and marker-only teleport selection for valid Nexus maps, including previously issued maps. Nexus maps now support bounded 100%-400% integer zoom and drag/keyboard pan without accidental marker selection. Observer protocol v3 reconstructs the production screen and relays only bounded semantic selection/zoom/pan state—never map pixels or framebuffers.\\n\\nMinecraft 26.2 · Fabric · Java 25 · requires TotemCore >=0.7.16 <0.8.0."
